OL,3,AMet investigates reports of letter
OL,4,Adetailing claims about Meghan's father
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police says it is
OL,7,Finvestigating reports that a letter was
OL,8,Fsent to one of its specialist units in
OL,9,F2018 containing allegations about
OL,10,FThomas Markle, the father of the
OL,11,FDuchess of Sussex.
OL,13,FMeghan released a statement saying that
OL,14,Fa letter was sent to the force
OL,15,Fcontaining "disturbing allegations"
OL,16,Fabout the behaviour of her estranged
OL,17,Ffather, and subsequently shared with
OL,18,Fher.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
