OL,3,AMet investigates reports of letter
OL,4,Adetailing claims about Meghan's father
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, it was reported that images
OL,7,Fof child sexual abuse allegedly
OL,8,Fbelonging to Markle, 82, were found in
OL,9,Fhis former home in the Philippines. The
OL,10,FSun newspaper, which first carried the
OL,11,Fclaims, later said that the letter made
OL,12,Fdirect allegations of child sex abuse
OL,13,Fagainst him.
OL,15,FUK police are not investigating Thomas
OL,16,FMarkle, who is based in the US and
OL,17,Fstrenuously denies the allegations made
OL,18,Fagainst him.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
